<title>ZAIRE: Zaire talks on S.African ship Wednesday -rebels.</title>
<headline>Zaire talks on S.African ship Wednesday -rebels.</headline>
<dateline>LUBUMBASHI, Zaire 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Zairean rebel spokesman said on Friday that next week's meeting between rebel leader Laurent Kabila and President Mobutu Sese Seko would be aboard a South African navy vessel.</p>
<p>&quot;Mobutu and Kabila will be meeting next week on Wednesday on a South African navy ship,&quot; Kabila's &quot;foreign minister&quot;, Bizima Karaha, told Reuters at Lubumbashi airport.</p>
</text>
